<title>PAKISTAN: Karachi port handles 90,246 tonnes cargo.</title>
<headline>Karachi port handles 90,246 tonnes cargo.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's Karachi Port Trust said it had handled 90,246 tonnes of export and import cargo in the 24 hours to 0200 GMT on Wednesday compared with 46,437 tonnes in the same period on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Cargo handling in tonnes:</p>
<p>				    Wednesday   Dec 17</p>
<p>    Export cargo		13,835	11,676</p>
<p>    Import cargo		76,411	34,761</p>
<p>In the past 24 hours, three ships sailed and three berthed. In the next 24 hours, five are expected to sail and 10 are expected to arrive.</p>
</text>
